# Committed intentionally: the Supabase anon key is designed to be public/client-side --
# Supabase's Row Level Security enforces access, not this key (same trust model as a Firebase
# web API key). This is NOT the service_role key, which must never leave the server.
# Vite bakes VITE_-prefixed vars into the build at compile time, so this must be a real file
# here rather than a platform-only env var, regardless of how Cloudflare Pages' build step
# sources its environment.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://vzvemgdmquypusxlbacm.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6InZ6dmVtZ2RtcXV5cHVzeGxiYWNtIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODUzNzA4OTAsImV4cCI6MjEwMDk0Njg5MH0.L1wKyT00skh7gcELGbCubCwSWgeM10Zjue762vAUjus
